{'symbol': 'NRG', 'date': '2021-02-04 07:59:00', 'title': 'NRG ENERGY ANNOUNCES CFO TRANSITION', 'text': "PRINCETON, N.J.--(BUSINESS WIRE)---- $NRG--NRG ENERGY, INC. (NYSE: NRG) TODAY ANNOUNCED KIRKLAND ANDREWS IS STEPPING DOWN AS CHIEF FINANCIAL OFFICER (CFO), EFFECTIVE FEBRUARY 4, 2021. MR. ANDREWS WILL REMAIN WITH NRG IN AN ADVISORY CAPACITY THROUGH FEBRUARY 19, 2021. NRG HAS APPOINTED MR. GAETAN FROTTE, THE COMPANY'S SENIOR VICE PRESIDENT AND TREASURER, TO SERVE AS INTERIM CFO EFFECTIVE FEBRUARY 4, 2021. “KIRK'S LEADERSHIP AND COUNSEL HELPED ACHIEVE THE FINANCIAL FOUNDATION AND SIMPLICITY THAT UNDERPINS"}